I wake up early today.
It is spring in Berlin.
The sun shines brightly into the flat.
I lie in bed for a moment.
Then I get up.
I go into the kitchen.
I make the coffee.
The coffee smells very good.
I sit at the table.
I drink slowly.
The morning is very quiet.
I enjoy the time.
Now I am ready for the day.
I pack the laptop into the backpack.
I take my keys.
I leave the flat.
I walk to the U-Bahn.
